{"id":"81f28324a46f750e","url":"https://meghalayahighcourt.nic.in/sites/default/files/news/N405.pdf","title":"Notification 03.11.2026: Nodal officer of the High Court of Meghalaya for c...","source":{"id":"meghalayahighcourt.nic.in","name":"Meghalaya High Court","pageUrl":"https://meghalayahighcourt.nic.in/constitution-of-bench","state":"ALL"},"text":"KEY LINES:\n\n\nFULL TEXT:\nTHE HIGH COURT OF MEGHALAYA\nAT SHILLONG\nNO TIE I C AT JO N\nD,t,d, Shill,„g th, ah,v,mb„, 2026\nNo. HCM.I1/117/2026/Comp/UK : Hon'ble the Chief Justice is pleased to nominate\nthe Manager (IT) as the Nodal Officer of the High Court of Meghalaya for coordinating\nand facilitating cybercrime awareness initiatives in liaison with the Indian Cyber\nCrime Coordination Centre (14C), Ministry of Home Affairs, Government of India.\nThe Nodal Officer shall serve as the designated point of contact for\ncoordination with 14C and shall facilitate the receipt, circulation and dissemination of\nofficial cyber safety advisories, guidelines, awareness materials and other relevant\ninformation issued by 14C from time to time among the concerned judicial\nestablishments under the jurisdiction of the High Court of Meghalaya\nR ERAL\n2026DatedMemo No HCM.I1/117/2026/COMP/ wr,2 A\nCopy to:-\n1.\n11.\nRegistrar cum PPS to Hon’ble Chief Justice for favour of her Ladyship’s\nkind information\nP.S to Hon'ble Mr Justice H S Thangkhiew, Judge, High Court of Meghalaya\nfor favour of his Lordship’s kind information.\nP.S to Hon’ble Mr Justice W Diengdoh, Judge, High Court of Meghalaya for\nfavour of his Lordship’s kind information.\nP.S to Hon’ble Mr Justice B Bhattacharjee, Judge, High Court of Meghalaya\nfor favour of his Lordship’s kind information.\nRegistrar (Admin), High Court of Meghalaya\nAssistant Registrar (Establishment), High Court of Meghalaya\nSystem Analyst, High Court of Meghalaya for uploading the same in the\n=:::::'::,'„“'\"'''\"\"'’:;'~- V ’\n111.\nIV-\nV.\nVI\nVII.\nVIII\nREGISTRAR GENERAL","links